{"updated":"2026-09-16T05:27:17.308Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Live: EU chief Ursula von der Leyen gives State of the Union address. Elsewhere, australian politics live: Lambie says AI companies ‘like dinosaurs in Jurassic Park testing fences’; Burke plans to get net overseas migration down. And at least 10 dead, dozens missing in Gaza building collapse. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 2.6 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.0 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 2.8 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 39 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.0 near 60 km SSW of Ocós, Guatemala. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.94,1.11,1.44,1.56,1.6,1.64,1.66,1.71,1.73,1.75,1.78,1.83,1.88,1.96,2.02,2.07,2.1,2.14,2.18,2.22,2.24,2.3,2.35,2.38,2.42,2.46,2.51,2.55,2.6,2.65,2.72,2.77,2.84,2.96,3.05,3.23,3.25,3.29,3.32,3.37,3.41,3.46,3.58,3.66,3.71,3.79,3.83,3.89,3.94,3.98,4.03,4.05,4.08,4.13,4.16,4.18,4.2,4.25,4.3,4.38,4.43,4.5,4.57,4.63,4.69,4.72,4.78,4.81,4.87,4.98,5.13,5.34,5.94,6.03,6.2,6.26,6.38,6.46,6.73,6.91,7.12,7.19,7.22,7.28,7.34,7.4,7.46,7.58,7.7,7.77,7.84,7.91,7.98,8.02,8.09,8.15,8.22,8.26,8.3,8.32,8.38,8.41,8.47,8.52,8.64,8.68,8.78,8.86,9.07,9.16,9.23,9.28,9.32,9.35,9.38,9.43,9.48,9.57,9.61,9.66,9.68,9.72,9.74,9.79,9.81,9.83,9.86,9.95,10.03,10.1,10.16,10.21,10.24,10.3,10.33,10.38,10.44,10.51,10.6,10.66,10.81,10.98,11.68,11.8,11.85,11.91,11.96,11.99,12.04,12.07,12.13,12.19,12.23,12.25,12.28,12.32,12.35,12.41,12.46,12.52,12.57,12.63,12.68,12.71,12.77,12.81,12.88,12.93,12.99,13.05,13.12,13.18,13.22,13.29,13.36,13.48,13.5